WEBVTT

01:35.990 --> 01:38.289
[Too Young To Love]

01:38.440 --> 01:41.220
[Episode 12]

01:45.289 --> 01:46.620
Why did you call me here?

01:49.400 --> 01:50.560
Do you think...

01:51.130 --> 01:52.660
Shan likes you?

01:54.000 --> 01:55.880
Do I think Shan likes me?

01:57.259 --> 01:58.039
Or rather,

01:59.259 --> 02:01.280
has Shan ever told you he likes you?

02:01.900 --> 02:02.670
No.

02:03.760 --> 02:05.970
Has he ever contacted you first?

02:10.870 --> 02:12.250
Ever given you a gift?

02:13.470 --> 02:14.910
Do the drinks and cake

02:14.940 --> 02:16.000
he bought me count?

02:18.180 --> 02:19.740
Do you think they count?

02:21.030 --> 02:21.680
No.

02:22.310 --> 02:23.030
Then

02:23.200 --> 02:24.200
has he ever...

02:25.870 --> 02:27.079
tried to

02:27.079 --> 02:29.170
find chances to be alone with you?

02:29.470 --> 02:30.240
No.

02:31.680 --> 02:33.740
Why are you suddenly asking all this?

02:34.310 --> 02:37.470
He never said he liked you,

02:37.500 --> 02:39.920
never reached out to you first,

02:39.920 --> 02:41.200
never gave you a gift,

02:41.200 --> 02:44.310
and didn't even want to be alone with you.

02:45.470 --> 02:46.710
So, is it possible

02:47.150 --> 02:48.150
that Shan

02:48.750 --> 02:51.980
just sees you as

02:52.750 --> 02:53.920
a friend?

02:56.920 --> 02:58.030
Just a friend?

03:04.400 --> 03:06.660
I looked it up online this afternoon too.

03:07.030 --> 03:09.030
They say that when a guy likes a girl,

03:09.710 --> 03:11.370
it mainly shows in these ways:

03:12.030 --> 03:13.430
He gets jealous over her,

03:15.690 --> 03:17.760
shares his life with her,

03:18.590 --> 03:20.710
and gets possessive of her.

03:21.310 --> 03:21.920
And...

03:22.710 --> 03:24.970
the guy actively apologizes to the girl.

03:25.640 --> 03:27.440
He doesn't seem to do any of that.

03:33.150 --> 03:35.079
I have a basketball game
in a couple of days.

03:35.079 --> 03:36.880
Remember to come and cheer me on.

03:37.200 --> 03:38.079
Of course.

03:39.360 --> 03:41.560
If there's nothing else, I'll head out.

03:50.870 --> 03:51.829
I've already

03:51.920 --> 03:53.710
adjusted the exposure on all these photos.

03:53.710 --> 03:55.150
Want to get them developed together?

03:55.150 --> 03:56.610
They're all photos of you.

03:57.590 --> 03:58.520
So will these...

03:58.990 --> 04:01.200
appear immediately after developing?

04:02.750 --> 04:03.110
Mm.

04:03.640 --> 04:04.590
That magical?

04:05.590 --> 04:06.640
I want to try.

04:11.150 --> 04:12.150
Teach me.

04:13.030 --> 04:13.710
So...

04:14.360 --> 04:15.200
do I...

04:16.519 --> 04:18.250
put the whole picture in first?

04:18.519 --> 04:18.880
Yes.

04:19.029 --> 04:20.360
Just put it in this tray.

04:20.440 --> 04:24.160
♪ I watch the rain drift softly
over the city ♪

04:23.320 --> 04:24.450
-And then?
-Then...

04:24.450 --> 04:28.570
♪ As if you took all the sunshine with you
when you left ♪

04:26.350 --> 04:28.610
hold the tray steady and shake it gently.

04:28.740 --> 04:32.560
♪ The old lanes we walked
are flooded with memories of us ♪

04:30.200 --> 04:30.840
Slower.

04:32.760 --> 04:33.270
Like this.

04:32.810 --> 04:36.430
♪ Now, I just stand here
as lovers brush past me ♪

04:34.710 --> 04:36.150
Shake it gently

04:36.710 --> 04:39.080
so the developer flows evenly.

04:36.880 --> 04:40.900
♪ Some remain forever young and free ♪

04:41.040 --> 04:45.040
♪ In their eyes, I see you and me ♪

04:45.190 --> 04:49.210
♪ The lonely air surrounds me ♪

04:49.670 --> 04:52.000
♪ Shutting out the noise
and all the warmth ♪

04:52.400 --> 04:53.270
Amazing.

04:52.490 --> 04:55.659
♪ Leaving only silence ♪

04:53.590 --> 04:55.520
The image appeared instantly.

04:56.950 --> 05:00.530
♪ I wish I could be a goldfish ♪

05:01.020 --> 05:04.840
♪ With its so-called seven-second memory ♪

05:05.160 --> 05:06.920
♪ Seven was the moment we first met ♪

05:06.030 --> 05:07.270
You made me look so good.

05:07.240 --> 05:08.960
♪ Six was when we grew close ♪

05:08.710 --> 05:09.970
You've always been beautiful.

05:09.240 --> 05:11.550
♪ Now, there's just an empty space
beside me ♪

05:21.580 --> 05:22.660
I just remembered,

05:23.030 --> 05:25.690
I still have homework to finish
back at the dorm.

05:26.640 --> 05:27.700
I'll go back first.

05:28.320 --> 05:29.640
See you at the basketball game.

05:29.640 --> 05:30.060
Okay.

05:33.370 --> 05:36.970
♪ I wish I could be a goldfish ♪

05:37.280 --> 05:41.120
♪ With its so-called seven-second memory ♪

05:41.480 --> 05:43.210
♪ Seven was the moment we first met ♪

05:43.080 --> 05:45.260
Is something wrong with my heart lately?

05:43.440 --> 05:45.220
♪ Six was when we grew close ♪

05:45.600 --> 05:49.690
♪ Now, there's just an empty space
beside me where you should be ♪

05:45.640 --> 05:48.240
Why does my heart race
every time I see someone?

05:49.590 --> 05:50.740
I should probably go to the hospital
and get it checked.

05:49.770 --> 05:53.480
♪ I wish I could be a goldfish ♪

05:54.020 --> 05:57.640
♪ So I wouldn't be swallowed
by memories anymore ♪

05:57.940 --> 05:59.710
♪ Five was all the hugs we shared ♪

06:00.070 --> 06:01.820
♪ Four was the moment we broke up ♪

06:02.160 --> 06:09.330
♪ Three, two, one,
and I can finally forget you ♪

06:03.840 --> 06:04.970
I'm back at the dorm.

06:05.400 --> 06:06.400
Go to bed early.

06:20.470 --> 06:22.150
Why are you lifting such a heavy weight?

06:22.150 --> 06:23.480
You have to start light.

06:25.320 --> 06:26.180
I can handle it.

06:33.909 --> 06:37.510
Did your girlfriend say your muscles are
too small or something?

06:51.840 --> 06:53.170
Come on, let me help you.

06:53.710 --> 06:54.310
Thanks...

06:54.470 --> 06:55.400
You're welcome.

06:59.590 --> 07:00.960
I got here first!

07:10.960 --> 07:12.080
Xiaole.

07:12.840 --> 07:14.150
You saved a practice room for me?

07:14.150 --> 07:15.120
You're so nice!

07:15.270 --> 07:17.200
I know you can't get one on your own.

07:18.320 --> 07:18.910
Go in and practice.

07:18.910 --> 07:19.970
I won't bother you.

07:25.320 --> 07:26.710
Luo, give me a hand here!

07:27.080 --> 07:28.080
Oh, coming.

07:39.270 --> 07:41.000
Luo, the guests here have left!

07:41.960 --> 07:42.520
Coming.

08:05.710 --> 08:07.640
Ning, you're going out?

08:08.150 --> 08:08.710
Where are you going?

08:08.710 --> 08:09.710
Let me carry those for you.

08:09.710 --> 08:10.270
No need.

08:10.710 --> 08:13.080
Why'd you come to my school
without saying anything?

08:13.080 --> 08:14.550
I missed you.

08:14.710 --> 08:15.710
Let me carry those.

08:15.710 --> 08:16.510
Really, no...

08:22.080 --> 08:22.630
Why...

08:23.400 --> 08:25.060
are you carrying so many bags?

08:26.150 --> 08:27.840
I'm going to sell them
at the secondhand market.

08:27.840 --> 08:29.030
Do you need to buy something?

08:29.030 --> 08:30.430
I can buy it for you first.

08:32.080 --> 08:33.409
This is my own business.

08:35.710 --> 08:36.320
Then...

08:38.510 --> 08:40.640
I already drove here. Let me drive you.

08:42.510 --> 08:43.039
Let's go.

08:50.350 --> 08:50.990
Ning,

08:51.280 --> 08:52.800
if you're having any difficulties,

08:52.800 --> 08:54.040
you can just tell me.

08:54.510 --> 08:55.870
I really can help you.

08:59.110 --> 09:00.710
Sometimes I really envy you—

09:00.800 --> 09:02.860
nothing seems to be a problem for you.

09:03.280 --> 09:05.140
I hope you can always be like this.

09:07.920 --> 09:08.390
Also,

09:08.750 --> 09:10.990
don't drive a sports car
to my school anymore.

09:10.990 --> 09:12.520
You don't go to this school.

09:12.750 --> 09:13.680
It's too flashy.

09:20.280 --> 09:20.800
Is it?

09:24.510 --> 09:25.870
I'll get going then!

09:28.750 --> 09:29.680
I just feel like

09:30.630 --> 09:32.560
Ning doesn't feel anything for me.

09:33.440 --> 09:34.800
If she didn't have feelings for you,

09:34.800 --> 09:36.870
why would she date you?

09:40.920 --> 09:43.780
Then why is it
that every time I come looking for her,

09:44.160 --> 09:45.470
she says she's busy?

09:46.230 --> 09:48.560
And she never talks to me about her life.

09:49.630 --> 09:52.360
Is it possible
that she just doesn't want to say it

09:52.390 --> 09:53.870
or can't say it?

09:54.560 --> 09:56.440
Why do you have to know anyway?

09:58.510 --> 10:00.500
It's not that I have to know,

10:00.630 --> 10:02.920
but aren't relationships supposed to be
about supporting each other?

10:02.920 --> 10:04.040
Just like my parents—

10:04.040 --> 10:05.350
they talk about everything,

10:05.350 --> 10:08.610
and when they run into problems,
they solve them together.

10:10.560 --> 10:13.360
Something has happened
with her family recently.

10:13.510 --> 10:15.840
It's understandable that she doesn't...

10:16.230 --> 10:18.160
want to talk about certain things.

10:21.160 --> 10:21.960
Then tell me,

10:22.990 --> 10:24.120
what should I do now?

10:30.630 --> 10:32.160
See? You don't know either.

10:33.390 --> 10:35.390
But I think for things like this,

10:35.390 --> 10:37.450
you have to find the answer yourself.

10:37.920 --> 10:40.280
I just can't find it!

10:44.510 --> 10:45.640
You like her, right?

10:45.750 --> 10:46.210
Yeah.

10:46.350 --> 10:48.280
Then being with her must make you happy.

10:48.280 --> 10:48.750
Yeah!

10:49.160 --> 10:52.510
Then just care for her
and look after her every day.

10:52.510 --> 10:53.640
One day,

10:54.160 --> 10:56.360
when she wants to talk, she'll tell you.

10:57.280 --> 10:59.920
But I feel like
she doesn't need my concern.

11:00.160 --> 11:02.440
She makes me feel completely useless.

11:02.440 --> 11:03.510
Just like what my parents say—

11:03.510 --> 11:04.680
I can just kick back

11:04.680 --> 11:06.540
as a rich kid and not lift a finger.

11:09.870 --> 11:11.470
I really envy your life.

11:11.800 --> 11:13.440
Ning said the same thing.

11:13.440 --> 11:14.630
Can you help me figure out

11:14.630 --> 11:16.960
how to get closer to her?

11:18.750 --> 11:21.350
I'd like someone to help me.

11:22.990 --> 11:23.920
Something's up?

11:24.350 --> 11:26.230
What could be up?

11:26.280 --> 11:27.540
What are you two doing?

11:30.920 --> 11:32.380
According to my analysis,

11:33.040 --> 11:35.560
Ning is a girl with a lot of pride.

11:36.390 --> 11:38.440
She doesn't easily accept help
from others.

11:38.440 --> 11:39.560
With a lot of things,

11:39.560 --> 11:41.490
you can't be too direct with her.

11:42.750 --> 11:43.390
But

11:43.920 --> 11:46.280
when you show you care,

11:46.630 --> 11:48.960
you can be a little more straightforward.

11:49.630 --> 11:51.430
Are you writing a thesis or what?

11:51.750 --> 11:52.510
What are you even talking about?

11:52.510 --> 11:55.570
What do you mean
by all this "direct or not direct" talk?

11:55.750 --> 11:58.160
Girls are just a bit complicated.

11:58.160 --> 12:00.290
How can you not understand Ning at all?

12:00.920 --> 12:03.450
It's still because you don't
understand her.

12:03.560 --> 12:05.710
The point is, she has never

12:06.160 --> 12:07.950
talked to me about herself.

12:08.560 --> 12:10.220
Every time we go out, it's just

12:10.350 --> 12:11.350
eating together,

12:11.630 --> 12:12.630
and then I crack a few jokes

12:12.630 --> 12:15.040
and share a few memes to make her laugh.

12:17.040 --> 12:18.440
Now that I think about it,

12:19.160 --> 12:20.090
it seems like...

12:20.750 --> 12:22.680
we've never even had a proper date.

12:23.710 --> 12:25.840
They've never been on a proper date...

12:26.160 --> 12:27.650
So what?

12:28.390 --> 12:30.160
If she didn't have feelings for you,

12:30.160 --> 12:31.750
she wouldn't be dating you.

12:32.680 --> 12:33.160
Didn't I

12:33.510 --> 12:34.680
just say that?

12:37.370 --> 12:39.090
Before we started dating,

12:39.110 --> 12:41.630
I felt pretty relaxed around her.

12:41.630 --> 12:43.090
But after we got together,

12:43.160 --> 12:43.960
I feel like...

12:44.920 --> 12:46.230
every day I'm just

12:47.160 --> 12:48.420
walking on eggshells,

12:48.510 --> 12:50.570
trying to do things to make her happy.

12:53.230 --> 12:54.680
This relationship of yours

12:54.680 --> 12:56.210
sounds really exhausting.

12:59.280 --> 13:00.810
Don't be such a wet blanket.

13:04.800 --> 13:06.800
Ning's been pretty busy these days.

13:06.920 --> 13:08.710
How about when she's free, I'll help you

13:08.710 --> 13:09.510
sound her out?

13:09.800 --> 13:11.390
I guess that's the only way.

13:13.040 --> 13:14.040
I'm going to class.

13:14.040 --> 13:14.770
See you guys.

13:16.990 --> 13:17.990
Leaving already?

13:23.990 --> 13:27.870
I have to say,
you're way too much of a coward.

13:27.870 --> 13:30.920
Still zero progress since high school?

13:31.230 --> 13:32.160
Who says?

13:33.230 --> 13:34.560
Mind your own business.

13:35.920 --> 13:38.720
I'm telling you, to win a girl over,
you need to act.

13:38.990 --> 13:41.560
Take action—action is everything!

13:48.440 --> 13:49.640
Let me go find the one.

14:00.800 --> 14:02.000
Your piano's broken?

14:02.560 --> 14:04.220
They sent you to fix the piano?

14:05.110 --> 14:06.240
I'll take you there.

14:14.390 --> 14:16.390
You're really here to fix the piano?

14:16.840 --> 14:17.510
Why else?

14:19.870 --> 14:21.400
I thought you came to see me.

14:23.200 --> 14:25.000
I'm really here to fix the piano.

14:43.560 --> 14:44.160
I...

14:44.800 --> 14:46.260
forgot to bring the parts.

14:47.680 --> 14:48.280
Oh.

14:50.230 --> 14:51.160
I really forgot.

14:51.680 --> 14:52.160
Mmhmm.

14:56.390 --> 14:56.860
So...

14:57.350 --> 14:57.920
I'll

14:58.230 --> 14:59.560
go back and get them now.

15:01.040 --> 15:01.570
Go ahead.

15:17.560 --> 15:18.760
I'll go with you then.

15:21.780 --> 15:22.040
T-That's

15:22.040 --> 15:22.630
fine.

15:37.440 --> 15:38.040
Nice shot!

15:44.750 --> 15:46.080
What are you looking at?

15:47.280 --> 15:48.210
The game is over?

15:49.230 --> 15:49.590
Cool!

15:55.510 --> 15:56.840
I think I just saw Shan.

15:57.280 --> 15:57.920
Shan?

15:58.750 --> 15:59.680
I don't think so.

15:59.870 --> 16:01.400
Didn't I play well just now?

16:01.630 --> 16:02.390
You did.

16:03.040 --> 16:03.510
Xiaole!

16:06.680 --> 16:08.010
Show us what you've got.

16:08.040 --> 16:09.770
Watch out, there's a girl here.

16:11.510 --> 16:12.370
That scared me.

16:12.630 --> 16:14.110
I definitely saw Shan.

16:15.280 --> 16:16.410
Why didn't I see him?

16:16.800 --> 16:18.060
Are you seeing things?

16:18.800 --> 16:19.280
Fine.

16:19.750 --> 16:21.280
I'm heading to his shop now.

16:21.280 --> 16:21.910
See you.

16:23.870 --> 16:25.390
I'm going there too.

16:25.390 --> 16:27.350
Why don't you wait for me to change first?

16:27.350 --> 16:29.010
I just got a new batch of books.

16:29.230 --> 16:29.850
Let's go.

16:55.110 --> 16:56.230
Can you find them?

16:57.630 --> 16:58.430
Just a moment.

17:34.150 --> 17:35.720
Uh, sorry.

17:36.190 --> 17:37.320
The parts haven't arrived yet.

17:37.320 --> 17:40.120
It might take a few days
before we can install them.

17:41.720 --> 17:43.450
You still have feelings for me.

17:44.150 --> 17:44.590
Huh?

17:48.080 --> 17:49.810
You still have feelings for me.

17:51.630 --> 17:52.560
What do you want?

18:22.670 --> 18:23.480
Shh.

18:24.800 --> 18:25.600
What's wrong?

18:26.390 --> 18:28.050
What's wrong? What happened?

18:39.800 --> 18:42.130
Why did you leave without saying goodbye?

18:42.950 --> 18:44.410
Haven't you always known?

18:48.240 --> 18:49.390
So now...

18:52.630 --> 18:53.480
you regret it?

19:35.190 --> 19:37.560
What? What?

19:37.910 --> 19:38.630
What did you see?

19:38.630 --> 19:39.670
Tell me, quickly.

19:39.670 --> 19:40.910
Let me eat a candy to calm my nerves.

19:40.910 --> 19:41.630
You have one too.

19:41.630 --> 19:42.800
Why should I eat one?

19:42.800 --> 19:46.200
I'm afraid what I'm about to say
might give you a heart attack.

19:46.910 --> 19:47.970
Can you tell me now?

19:50.080 --> 19:51.150
Tell me.

19:51.150 --> 19:53.950
-Let me swallow first!
-Hurry up! What did you see?

20:00.390 --> 20:01.190
Professor Ye?

20:01.390 --> 20:02.390
Stay here.

20:03.150 --> 20:04.040
Professor Ye!

20:13.220 --> 20:14.330
Professor Ye Mei!

20:16.480 --> 20:18.540
What a coincidence. Why are you here?

20:18.720 --> 20:20.310
I'm here to pick up parts for the piano.

20:20.310 --> 20:21.800
I work part-time
at this musical instrument store.

20:21.800 --> 20:23.800
Just come to me if you need anything.

20:24.560 --> 20:26.360
Has your boss ever mentioned me?

20:26.720 --> 20:28.560
No. Are you friends?

20:29.390 --> 20:30.050
Never mind.

20:32.390 --> 20:33.590
Goodbye, Professor.

20:40.560 --> 20:41.000
Shan,

20:41.840 --> 20:43.790
are you and Professor Ye dating?

20:49.630 --> 20:50.760
We're just friends.

20:52.390 --> 20:53.390
"Just friends"?

20:53.560 --> 20:54.000
Mm.

20:58.590 --> 20:59.150
Fine.

21:00.390 --> 21:01.190
Let me ask you,

21:01.390 --> 21:02.350
do you like Lan?

21:08.840 --> 21:10.150
Do you want me to say

21:10.350 --> 21:11.430
yes

21:11.840 --> 21:12.840
or no?

21:14.350 --> 21:15.880
Whether you like her or not,

21:16.320 --> 21:17.920
keep your distance from her.

21:20.390 --> 21:21.670
So, you like Lan.

21:22.870 --> 21:23.290
Right?

21:24.110 --> 21:25.590
She doesn't know yet, does she?

21:25.590 --> 21:27.390
Do you need me to tell her for you?

21:29.190 --> 21:30.320
That's my business.

21:32.190 --> 21:33.910
Shan Liwei, I'm warning you.

21:34.630 --> 21:36.110
If you dare hurt Yi Lan,

21:36.670 --> 21:38.400
I won't let you get away with it.

21:38.910 --> 21:40.710
You won't let me get away with it?

21:40.790 --> 21:43.630
You don't even have the courage
to confess your feelings.

21:43.630 --> 21:45.290
You call that liking someone?

21:51.320 --> 21:52.350
Shan, I'm here.

21:52.910 --> 21:53.640
You're here!

21:55.190 --> 21:55.780
Shan.

21:56.150 --> 21:58.350
Here, have a nougat. It'll cheer you up.

22:06.870 --> 22:07.240
Mm.

22:09.150 --> 22:10.150
So sweet.

22:12.430 --> 22:13.110
Lan.

22:14.560 --> 22:16.350
Later I'll order your favorite—

22:16.350 --> 22:16.910
pizza.

22:17.110 --> 22:17.970
How about that?

22:18.390 --> 22:19.800
Sure.

22:20.080 --> 22:21.160
Thanks, Shan.

22:21.320 --> 22:22.580
You're the best, Shan.

22:23.080 --> 22:24.010
You're welcome.

22:28.720 --> 22:29.350
Shan,

22:29.350 --> 22:30.730
let's go see a movie this weekend.

22:30.730 --> 22:31.490
My treat.

22:31.630 --> 22:32.100
Sure.

22:32.120 --> 22:33.980
Pick whatever you want. My treat.

22:34.390 --> 22:35.250
What do you want to watch?

22:35.250 --> 22:36.290
My treat.

22:39.240 --> 22:41.140
This is going to be a date
just for Shan and me.

22:41.140 --> 22:42.630
I'm warning you, stay out of it.

22:42.630 --> 22:43.430
Shan.

22:43.480 --> 22:44.080
Didn't you say

22:44.080 --> 22:46.080
we could all watch a movie together?

22:46.480 --> 22:46.950
Shan,

22:46.950 --> 22:48.910
didn't you say we'd watch a movie alone?

22:48.910 --> 22:50.390
Yeah, alone.

22:51.480 --> 22:52.480
I want to come too.

22:52.800 --> 22:53.630
Tong Xiaole!

22:57.430 --> 22:58.150
Where are you going?

22:57.500 --> 22:58.170
[Father and Son]

22:58.460 --> 23:02.290
[Father and Son]

22:58.800 --> 22:59.630
Heading back to school!

22:59.630 --> 23:00.890
Carry the cello for me!

23:02.820 --> 23:03.230
[Father and Son]

23:12.970 --> 23:15.960
[Father and Son]

23:22.800 --> 23:23.390
Yi Lan!

23:28.560 --> 23:29.150
Lan!

23:32.800 --> 23:33.590
Yi Lan!

23:36.300 --> 23:38.150
Why did you have to interfere?

23:38.390 --> 23:40.190
Do you really not want me to date?

23:40.350 --> 23:40.950
I'm warning you—

23:40.950 --> 23:42.000
if you keep interfering,

23:42.000 --> 23:43.110
you'll regret it!

23:45.150 --> 23:45.610
What...

23:47.080 --> 23:47.800
What did I do?

23:47.800 --> 23:49.670
Can't you see I like Shan?

23:52.240 --> 23:53.150
I know.

23:54.950 --> 23:56.010
But I don't know...

23:56.390 --> 23:56.850
what...

23:56.910 --> 23:58.710
what exactly you like about him.

23:59.910 --> 24:02.440
What I like about him
is none of your business.

24:05.110 --> 24:07.070
Anyway, you're my best friend.

24:07.630 --> 24:10.230
At worst, I'll just bring you along
on my dates.

24:12.000 --> 24:13.400
You'll bring me along...

24:14.430 --> 24:15.240
on your dates?

24:16.320 --> 24:18.910
Don't you have a girl you've liked
since high school?

24:18.910 --> 24:20.150
I'll help you chase her.

24:20.150 --> 24:22.590
Once you're dating,
the four of us can hang out together.

24:22.590 --> 24:23.150
Happy?

24:24.390 --> 24:24.920
Let's go.

24:39.720 --> 24:40.920
I bought this for you.

24:44.800 --> 24:45.630
What is it?

24:45.950 --> 24:47.240
A new card wallet.

24:47.630 --> 24:49.030
Yours is all worn out.

24:53.910 --> 24:54.430
Thanks.

24:55.390 --> 24:55.920
Let's go.

24:58.390 --> 24:59.920
Why are you walking so fast?

25:03.150 --> 25:06.080
Before I fell in love with you,
I'd forgotten your kiss—

25:06.080 --> 25:08.410
yet my heart always remembered your lips.

25:11.190 --> 25:12.080
Nice poem.

25:19.430 --> 25:20.230
What's wrong?

25:23.590 --> 25:24.480
Today,

25:25.190 --> 25:27.390
I just wanted to give you a chance
to impress her.

25:27.390 --> 25:28.990
I didn't expect to scare her.

25:30.080 --> 25:30.740
Is she okay?

25:32.080 --> 25:32.740
She's fine.

25:39.720 --> 25:41.630
Still nothing between you two?

25:43.150 --> 25:43.530
Look,

25:43.950 --> 25:46.150
as your bro, let me give you another tip.

25:46.150 --> 25:47.850
Find another girl

25:48.150 --> 25:49.390
and pretend to get close to her

25:49.390 --> 25:50.520
to make Lan jealous.

25:50.910 --> 25:52.240
I guarantee it'll work.

25:53.870 --> 25:55.280
Thank you.

25:56.720 --> 25:58.560
Stop dragging your feet.

25:58.630 --> 26:00.780
Just be direct and confess to her.

26:01.320 --> 26:01.870
Remember,

26:01.870 --> 26:04.000
girls hate wishy-washy guys the most.

26:04.890 --> 26:05.490
Be a man.

26:20.180 --> 26:22.510
Xiaole, what are you doing here?

26:23.350 --> 26:24.390
I have something to tell you.

26:24.390 --> 26:25.240
What is it?

26:25.240 --> 26:27.040
I need to go grab a practice room.

26:27.480 --> 26:28.210
Come with me.

26:30.910 --> 26:31.630
What for?

26:32.190 --> 26:34.190
I still need to grab a practice room!

26:35.560 --> 26:37.080
What's so urgent?

26:43.450 --> 26:45.240
I need to grab a practice room!

26:45.870 --> 26:46.670
What's wrong?

26:54.630 --> 26:57.230
Isn't this a photo of the two of us
from the ball?

26:59.590 --> 27:00.630
You developed it?

27:00.870 --> 27:01.630
Do you like it?

27:01.630 --> 27:02.090
Yeah.

27:02.350 --> 27:03.240
It looks good.

27:03.430 --> 27:04.690
It's very meaningful.

27:06.080 --> 27:06.560
Yi Lan.

27:08.870 --> 27:10.330
I remember you once told me

27:11.150 --> 27:14.150
that photography is
how I communicate with the world.

27:17.590 --> 27:18.520
But actually...

27:19.590 --> 27:21.670
when I took photos before,

27:22.190 --> 27:23.320
I was always unhappy

27:23.390 --> 27:24.990
and full of negative energy.

27:25.910 --> 27:27.970
You were the one who stayed by my side,

27:29.390 --> 27:30.250
encouraged me,

27:31.430 --> 27:33.760
and brought so much positivity to my life.

27:33.800 --> 27:34.910
So I want to tell you

27:36.430 --> 27:37.240
that you are

27:37.240 --> 27:39.870
my other way of
communicating with this world.

27:41.630 --> 27:42.230
Thank you.

27:44.390 --> 27:45.070
Of course.

27:45.390 --> 27:46.670
We're best friends.

27:47.150 --> 27:47.670
Then...

27:47.950 --> 27:48.810
I'll get going.

27:48.910 --> 27:49.380
Yi Lan!

27:56.110 --> 27:57.510
Is there something else?

27:59.560 --> 28:00.430
What's wrong?

28:01.000 --> 28:02.390
Just say it already.

28:06.350 --> 28:07.190
I like you.
